{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31298","headline":"秋日寄陈景孚秀才 · 刘威","name":"秋日寄陈景孚秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征车日已远，物候尚凄凄。\n风叶青桐落，露花红槿低。\n心随秦国远，梦到楚山迷。\n却恨衔芦鴈，秋飞不向西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}